### Solution

**Answer: B & D.**
<br>
**B**: <br>
$$
\begin{aligned}
    \frac{A}{r}&=\pi r \\
    r*\frac{A}{r}&=\pi r * r \\
    A&=\pi r^2 \\
\end{aligned}
$$

